# The config this box launches with is tracked: scripts/start-dsv41-single.sh --config rtx.local.json
# reads it, and its budgets (host_budget_gib, gpu_idle_max_mib, L2 slots) are part of what a
# measurement here means. The exception is this one path: generated start configs and fixtures under
# runtime/ (including release-secrets.local.json) stay ignored.
!/rtx.local.json
*.o
*.so
*.metallib
*.air
engines/ds4-mac/.paired-samplers/
